{# SECTION 3 — WHAT IS — Creative: real floor plan SVG not dashed, Story: dual-market cards with check icons, Perf: image aspect #}
<section class="bg-[#f8f8f8] py-[var(--linoxa-section)]">
  <div class="container-wx">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
        <h2 class="linoxa-h2 text-[#111111]">What Is Woodex 3D Studio™?</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 linoxa-body max-w-[640px] text-[#111]">
          <p>Woodex 3D Studio™ is the professional visualization division of Woodex Interior — producing photorealistic 3D renders, architectural animations, walkthrough videos, 360° virtual tours and shadow studies for interior design, architecture, real estate and commercial projects across Pakistan. The studio operates as an integrated part of Woodex Interior's design and build service — and as a fully independent visualization studio available to architects, developers and design firms who commission rendering work directly.</p>
          <p class="text-[#525252]">Photorealistic 3D visualization transforms architectural drawings, floor plans and interior design concepts into lifelike digital images — showing a space exactly as it will look when completed, before a single brick is laid or a single wall is painted. For developers and architects, this means the ability to present an unbuilt project with the visual confidence of a completed one. For interior design clients, it means approving the finished space — materials, lighting, furniture and atmosphere — before any physical work begins.</p>
          <p class="text-[#525252]">Woodex 3D Studio™ produces visualization output for a wide range of project types — office interiors, residential spaces, commercial fit-outs, architectural facades, real estate developments and furniture product visualization. The studio team combines technical 3D modelling expertise with a deep understanding of interior design and architecture — ensuring that every render is not only visually impressive but technically accurate to the drawings provided.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-[640px]">
          <div class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-white border-[#0f1e36]/10 hover:shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition">
            <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase font-semibold text-[#0f1e36] flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0f1e36] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">✓</span> Woodex Interior Clients</p>
            <p class="linoxa-sub mt-3 text-[#525252]">3D visualization is included in your design or turnkey package at no additional charge. You approve the completed space in 3D before any physical work begins.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#0f1e36] text-white hover:bg-[#121f3a] transition">
            <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase font-semibold text-white/70 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/15 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">✓</span> External Clients</p>
            <p class="linoxa-sub mt-3 text-white/70">Architects, developers, real estate companies, furniture manufacturers and international design firms can commission Woodex 3D Studio™ directly — independently of any interior design or fit-out service.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
