    <div class="mt-12">
      <div class="process-desktop hidden lg:block overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide pb-4" style="scroll-snap-type:x mandatory" aria-label="Process steps">
        <div class="flex gap-4" style="min-width:max-content">
          <div class="w-[280px] linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8] flex flex-col" style="scroll-snap-align:start"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><span class="text-[40px] font-medium leading-none text-[#0f1e36]/10">01</span><span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold mt-4 leading-tight text-[#111]">Brief and Drawing Submission</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-3 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">You submit your project brief, floor plans, elevations, reference images and any 3D model files you have. The more complete the information provided at this stage, the faster and more accurate the first draft render will be.</p></div>
          <div class="w-[280px] linoxa-card p-6 bg-white flex flex-col"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><span class="text-[40px] font-medium leading-none text-[#0f1e36]/10">02</span><span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#f8f8f8] flex items-center justify-center text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold mt-4 leading-tight text-[#111]">Scope Confirmation and Quotation</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-3 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">Based on the brief and drawings received, we confirm the scope — number of scenes, render type, estimated revision rounds and turnaround time — and issue a detailed quotation.</p></div>
