          <div class="w-[280px] linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8] flex flex-col"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><span class="text-[40px] font-medium leading-none text-[#0f1e36]/10">05</span><span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold mt-4 leading-tight text-[#111]">Material and Lighting Application</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-3 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">All materials, finishes, textures and lighting conditions specified in the brief are applied to the 3D model — including flooring, wall finishes, ceiling materials, furniture upholstery, joinery finishes.</p></div>
