        <details class="linoxa-card p-5 bg-[#f8f8f8] group"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[13px] text-[#111111]"><span>05 — Material and Lighting Application</span><span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">All materials, finishes, textures and lighting conditions specified in the brief are applied to the 3D model — including flooring, wall finishes, ceiling materials, furniture upholstery, joinery finishes.</p></details>
        <details class="linoxa-card p-5 bg-white group"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[13px] text-[#111111]"><span>06 — First Draft Render — Client Review</span><span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#f8f8f8] flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">A first draft render is produced at standard resolution for each scene and submitted for your review. You assess composition, materials, lighting and atmosphere — and provide consolidated feedback.</p></details>
        <details class="linoxa-card p-5 bg-[#f8f8f8] group"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[13px] text-[#111111]"><span>07 — Revision Rounds</span><span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">Agreed revision rounds are completed based on your feedback — adjusting materials, camera positions, lighting, furniture placement and any other elements identified in the review.</p></details>
        <details class="linoxa-card p-5 bg-white group"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[13px] text-[#111111]"><span>08 — Final High-Resolution Output</span><span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#f8f8f8] flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">Once revisions are approved, the final render is processed at full output resolution — suitable for large-format printing, presentation, marketing materials and digital use.</p></details>
        <details class="linoxa-card p-5 bg-[#f8f8f8] group"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[13px] text-[#111111]"><span>09 — Delivery and File Handover</span><span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252]">Final render files are delivered via secure file transfer in the agreed formats. For animation and virtual tour projects, the final video file or hosted tour link is delivered at this stage.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
