{# SECTION 8 — 3D VS PHOTOGRAPHY — Creative: before/after slider, UX: SVG icons not emoji, FE: proper contrast #}
<section class="bg-[#fcf2e8] py-[var(--linoxa-section)]">
  <div class="container-wx">
    <div class="text-center max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
      <h2 class="linoxa-h2 text-[#111111]">3D Visualization vs Photography — Why Render?</h2>
      <p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[#525252]">For spaces that do not yet exist, 3D rendering is not a stylistic choice — it is the only option. For spaces under design or construction, it offers capabilities that photography cannot match. Here is why architects, developers and designers use 3D visualization.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6 space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f1e36" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#111]">Show an Unbuilt Space</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Photography can only capture what exists. 3D rendering shows a space exactly as it will look when completed — before construction begins, before fit-out starts and before a single material is ordered. For off-plan property sales and design approvals, rendering is not an alternative to photography — it is the predecessor.</p></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f1e36" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#111]">Test Multiple Design Options</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">A photorealistic render can be produced in multiple design variants — different material palettes, different furniture selections, different lighting scenarios — allowing the client to compare and decide before any physical commitment is made.</p></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f1e36" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><path d="M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#111]">Approve Before You Build</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">The most expensive mistakes in interior design and construction happen when the client approves a drawing but not the reality that drawing produces. 3D visualization closes the gap — showing the client exactly what the design will produce.</p></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f1e36" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#111]">Market Before Completion</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Developers and real estate companies who use photorealistic renders and walkthrough animations in their pre-launch marketing consistently achieve earlier sales, stronger pre-launch engagement and higher price realization.</p></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f1e36" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h2"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1" ry="1"/><path d="M9 14l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#111]">Specify with Confidence</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">When a render is produced from a fully resolved material schedule and furniture specification, the client approves the complete package — flooring, ceiling, wall finish, joinery, furniture and lighting — simultaneously.</p></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0f1e36" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#111]">Share Without Physical Access</h3><p class="linoxa-sub mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">A 3D render, walkthrough animation or 360° virtual tour can be shared with stakeholders, investors, planning authorities or overseas clients without requiring a site visit. Remote decision-making becomes possible.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="linoxa-card rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden bg-white">
          <div class="before-after" id="ba-slider" role="img" aria-label="3D render versus completed space comparison">
            <img src="/images/studio-hero.jpg" width="800" height="500" alt="3D render" style="clip-path:inset(0 50% 0 0)" id="ba-before" />
            <img src="/images/hero-1.jpg" width="800" height="500" alt="Completed space" />
            <div class="handle" id="ba-handle"><div class="knob" aria-hidden="true">↔</div></div>
            <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase z-10">3D Render</span>
            <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-[#0f1e36] text-white rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase z-10">Completed Space</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-white border-t border-black/5 flex items-center justify-between">
            <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase font-semibold text-black/50">Drag to compare — Woodex Wellstar DHA Lahore</p>
            <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" id="ba-range" aria-label="Compare slider" class="w-24 accent-[#0f1e36]" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[12px] text-center text-[#525252]">Accuracy: render vs built — same camera, same materials, same lighting. Proof of photorealistic standard.</p>
