{# SECTION 12 — FAQ — FE: 10 Qs from Section 12 copy, UX: accordion + circle, SEO: FAQPage JSON-LD #}
<section class="bg-white py-[var(--linoxa-section)]">
  <div class="container-wx">
    <div class="text-center max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
      <h2 class="linoxa-h2 text-[#111111]">3D Visualization — Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[#525252]">Everything you need to know before commissioning — from drawings required to revision policy and delivery outside Lahore.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 max-w-[800px] mx-auto space-y-3" id="faq">
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8]" open><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q1: What is 3D interior rendering and how does it work? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">3D interior rendering is the process of producing a photorealistic digital image of an interior space — using 3D modelling software to build the space accurately from architectural drawings, apply real-world materials and lighting conditions, and render the scene into a high-resolution still image that shows the completed space as it will look when built or fitted out.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-white"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q2: What drawings or files do I need to provide to commission a 3D render? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#f8f8f8] flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">To produce an accurate 3D render, Woodex 3D Studio™ requires floor plans, elevations and ceiling plans at minimum — in PDF, DWG or DXF format. 3D model files — in SKP, FBX, OBJ or similar formats — accelerate the modelling process if available. Material samples, finish specifications, furniture references and atmosphere reference images all help the studio produce a more accurate and relevant result. We will confirm exactly what is needed based on your specific project.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8]"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q3: How photorealistic are the renders produced by Woodex 3D Studio™? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Woodex 3D Studio™ produces renders at photorealistic quality — using physically based rendering techniques that simulate real-world light behaviour, material properties and spatial depth. The output is indistinguishable from a professional interior photograph when the drawings and brief are complete. Portfolio examples are available in the gallery section above.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-white"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q4: How long does a 3D render take? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#f8f8f8] flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">A single interior still render of standard complexity typically takes 3–5 working days from confirmed brief to first draft. Complex scenes with curved ceilings, custom joinery and detailed lighting may take longer. Animated walkthroughs and virtual tours take 2–4 weeks depending on length and scene count. The confirmed turnaround timeline is included in every quotation before work begins.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8]"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q5: Can I commission 3D rendering without using Woodex Interior's design or fit-out services? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Yes. Woodex 3D Studio™ is fully available as a standalone service — independently of any interior design, fit-out or furniture service from Woodex Interior. Architects, developers, real estate companies, furniture manufacturers and marketing agencies can commission the studio directly.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-white"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q6: How many revision rounds are included? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#f8f8f8] flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Each Woodex 3D Studio™ quotation includes a standard number of revision rounds — typically two — within the confirmed project fee. Additional revisions beyond the included scope are charged at a confirmed per-revision rate, agreed before work begins. Providing a clear, complete brief and consolidated feedback at each review stage is the most effective way to stay within the included revision scope.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8]"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q7: Can Woodex 3D Studio™ produce visualization for projects outside Lahore? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Yes. Woodex 3D Studio™ provides 3D visualization for projects across Pakistan — in Lahore, Islamabad, Karachi and all other cities — as well as for international clients commissioning renders of Pakistan-based projects. Visualization is a remote-deliverable service — location does not affect the studio's ability to produce and deliver the output.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-white"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q8: What software does Woodex 3D Studio™ use? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Woodex 3D Studio™ uses industry-standard 3D visualization software including 3ds Max, V-Ray, Lumion and Enscape — selected based on the project type, output format and required render style. Software preferences from external clients — particularly architectural practices with an existing workflow — can be accommodated where technically feasible.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-[#f8f8f8]"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q9: Can I get a walkthrough animation and still renders from the same project? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Yes. Woodex 3D Studio™ produces multiple output types from the same 3D model — still renders, walkthrough animations and 360° virtual tours can all be delivered from a single modelling session. Commissioning multiple output types from the same project is more cost-effective than separate commissions.</p></details>
      <details class="linoxa-card p-6 bg-white"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-[14px] text-[#111]">Q10: Is 3D visualization included in Woodex Interior's design and fit-out packages? <span class="acc-icon w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[14px] transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="linoxa-sub mt-4 text-[13px] text-[#525252]">Yes. For clients commissioning interior design, turnkey design and build, or office fit-out through Woodex Interior, 3D photorealistic interior rendering is included in the design package — at no additional charge. The 3D renders are produced by Woodex 3D Studio™ directly from the design team's drawings and material schedules.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

